1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:16,570
Long ago there was a man called Daniel. When he was young he was taken far from home, to the great city of Babylon. He loved God more than anything, and he prayed to Him every day.

2
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:24,790
Daniel, you're wise and you're honest. I can trust you with anything! I'm going to put you in charge of my whole kingdom!

3
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:34,880
Thank you, Your Majesty! I'll do my very best. Any wisdom I have... comes from God.

4
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:45,900
Hmph! Why him? I looked and looked for something he did wrong... and I couldn't find a thing! He's too honest!

5
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:57,060
Wait a minute... he prays to his God every day. Heh heh. I've got an idea!

6
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:10,970
O great King, live forever! Please make a new law: for thirty days, everyone must pray only to you! Anyone who doesn't gets thrown to the lions!

7
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:19,240
Only to me? Hmm... that sounds rather nice! Seal it!

8
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:32,740
Daniel heard about the new law. But he went home just as he always did, opened his window toward Jerusalem, and knelt down to pray, three times a day.

9
00:01:37,710 --> 00:01:52,200
Dear God, I know about the new law... but You are my God, and I will pray only to You. Please help me, and please help our king too.

10
00:01:57,200 --> 00:02:04,460
Shh! Look! He's praying! Got you now! Heh heh heh, I'm going straight to the king!

11
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:14,710
Your Majesty! Daniel broke your law! He's still praying to his God! Throw him to the lions!

12
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:22,280
What? Daniel? No, no... I have to find a way to save him!

13
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:31,960
Oh, Your Majesty, did you forget? A law with your seal on it can never be changed!

14
00:02:33,190 --> 00:02:35,900
Oh... how could I be so foolish!

15
00:02:39,550 --> 00:02:44,160
The king had no choice. Daniel was taken to the lions' den.

16
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:50,260
Daniel... the God you serve every day... He will save you!

17
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:57,820
Don't be afraid, Your Majesty. God is with me.

18
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:17,410
It was dark in the den. The lions crept closer and closer... but Daniel wasn't afraid. He knelt down and prayed.

19
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:31,440
Suddenly, a light shone in! God sent an angel to shut the lions' mouths. And look... the lion gave a great big yawn, lay down, and purred like a giant kitty cat!

20
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:37,810
All night long the king couldn't eat, and he couldn't sleep.

21
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:44,170
Oh dear... how is Daniel? I can't sleep... I just can't sleep!

22
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:55,910
Daniel! Daniel! Has your God... been able to save you?

23
00:03:58,740 --> 00:04:05,890
Your Majesty, I'm fine! God sent His angel to shut the lions' mouths. They didn't hurt me at all!

24
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:11,090
Wonderful! Quick, quick, roll the stone away!

25
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:19,210
Daniel walked out of the lions' den without a single scratch! Because he trusted in God.

26
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:23,800
Uh... well... I'll just be going now...

27
00:04:27,790 --> 00:04:30,240
Waaah! Help!

28
00:04:35,810 --> 00:04:43,760
Hear this, everyone in my kingdom! Daniel's God is the living God! He rescues, and He keeps His people safe!

29
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:53,420
Even when things were hard, Daniel kept on praying. You can talk to God any time too. He's always listening!
